OL,3,GNEWSALive music to raise cash for
OL,4,AChristmas dinners
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity is hosting a music event to
OL,7,Ffund a project that helps families with
OL,8,Fthe costs of Christmas.
OL,10,FThe Greenaway Foundation provides
OL,11,Ffamilies in Kent, Sussex and Surrey
OL,12,Fwith ingredients for a two-course
OL,13,FChristmas dinner to help with the costs
OL,14,Fof the festive season.
OL,16,FThe organisation hosts a music
OL,17,Ffestival, Greenaway Live, at Crawley
OL,18,FRugby Club from 15:00 BST on Saturday,
OL,19,Fwith ticket sales helping fund its work
OL,20,Ffor families struggling financially.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
