OL,3,GNEWSALive music to raise cash for
OL,4,AChristmas dinners
OL,5,
OL,6,FDarren Greenaway, who founded the
OL,7,Fcharity, said the Christmas project was
OL,8,F"getting bigger and bigger, so this
OL,9,Fyear we need to raise about #200,000".
